  "notes": "v181: P&L is now just the chart it should be — the Monthly analysis (miles from the odometer, revenue, fuel, salaries, expenses, profit) with a custom date picker, and everything else off the screen: no crew record dumps, no driver-wages detail block, no breakdown cards. Wages now count every day in the period, for your own days and connected drivers alike, in a month or a custom range. The odometer is one fact across the whole app — a verified reading anywhere on a day corrects that day everywhere. Fill-ups show the latest 3 with a Show more door. Office-only accounts no longer inherit driver screens from an old default. The Inspection Mode PIN screen now says in plain words what the PIN is for. Every service interval follows the PM interval until you set your own number.",
